 MODEL_ACCESS_CHANGES.md                   | 56 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 config/postgres/initdb.d/01_create_db.sql |  3 +-
 configure.sh                              | 11 +++++
 costrict.sh                               |  4 ++
 docker-compose.yml.tpl                    | 23 ++++++++--
